      "x": 46.9,
      "y": 13,
      "text": "A polyPatch is controlled voice messages that correspond to MIDI Channel Voice Message like NOTE_ON, NOTE_ON, PITCH_BEND, CONTROL_CHANGE, etc.\n\nTo Do:\n* Press multiple keys, eg. Q, E, T. Hear a major chord.\n* Move the knob and hear the chord bend up and down by up to 2 semitones.\n* Set the tag on the packBend module to 60. Now only the \"Q\" note (60) will get bent. A tag of -1 means ALL notes.",
